    <statement><p>Simplify the expression
<me>\frac{5 x^3-8 x^2-4 x}{4 x^2-12 x+8}</me>
and give your answer in the form of
<me>\frac{f(x)}{g(x)}</me>
where <m>f(x)</m> and <m>g(x)</m> are polynomials with no common factors.</p>
<p>Your answer for the function <m>f(x)</m> is : <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p>Your answer for the function <m>g(x)</m> is : <fillin characters="10" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>x\mathopen{}\left(5x+2\right)</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>4x-4</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
